      <title>在受到可信的伊朗威胁后，特朗普在北约峰会上改用旧空军一号</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/trump-plane-iran-threat.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这一威胁导致特勤局敦促特朗普总统乘坐这架旧飞机离开土耳其，引发了人们对卡塔尔捐赠的飞机安全的质疑。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/trump-plane-iran-threat.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 22:01:50 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>派拉蒙同意将华纳兄弟的合并推迟数月</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/business/media/paramount-warner-bros-merger-delayed.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[该公司同意提议冻结至 2027 年 6 月，除非法官在此之前就阻止该交易的诉讼做出裁决。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/business/media/paramount-warner-bros-merger-delayed.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 21:42:57 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>康奈尔大学、西北大学和其他大学计划在中东校区开设课程</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/middle-east-campuses-american-universities.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[即使在美国和伊朗之间的停火协议破裂之后，美国大学仍希望在卡塔尔和阿拉伯联合酋长国任教，并且一个新的前哨基地也有望在沙特阿拉伯开设。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/middle-east-campuses-american-universities.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 21:32:37 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FDA专家组对肽的投票引发了对处方热潮的担忧</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/fda-panel-vote-peptides.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[该委员会支持在监管宽松的复合药房中更广泛地使用这些肽，这些药房已发展成为价值数十亿美元的业务。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/fda-panel-vote-peptides.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 21:15:21 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普政府承认取消对未投票给他的州的拨款</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/business/trump-state-grants-canceled.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[联邦官员在法庭文件中表示，他们“仅仅因为”各州是否在 2024 年大选中支持特朗普总统而停止向各州提供数十亿美元的能源项目资金。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/business/trump-state-grants-canceled.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 21:10:48 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>CDC。将与卷心生菜有关的环孢子虫疫情扩大到九个州</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/well/eat/cyclospora-outbreak-states-cdc.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[伊利诺伊州、堪萨斯州、俄克拉荷马州和宾夕法尼亚州现在加入密歇根州、俄亥俄州、印第安纳州、肯塔基州和西弗吉尼亚州的行列，爆发与卷心生菜有关的环孢子虫疫情。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/well/eat/cyclospora-outbreak-states-cdc.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 20:59:28 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
